          <tr class="family"><th scope="col" colspan="7">M4 &mdash; 2024 &middot; 3&nbsp;nm (2nd gen) · hardware ray tracing</th></tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">M4<span class="chip-meta">Air · mini · iMac · iPad&nbsp;Pro</span></th>
